Vendored here as Hermes skills for the doheeplay bot:
- .agents/skills/webtoon-{orchestrator,trend-research,scenario,panel-breakdown,panel-render,assembly}/
  are the upstream .claude/skills/ directories, unchanged except for the first sentence of each
  SKILL.md description (marked "[doheeplay]"), which routes requests to webtoon-dohee instead.
- .agents/skills/webtoon-orchestrator/references/agents/ holds the upstream .claude/agents/ role
  cards, unchanged. Hermes does not load them as agents; webtoon-dohee reads them as role notes.
- .agents/skills/webtoon-dohee/ is new: the entry point that adapts the harness to this repo
  (rig-gen images or the child's own drawings, 10–20 panels, HTML-overlay bubbles, GitHub Pages).
